LC 724 — Find Pivot Index
Pattern:Prefix Sum

Algorithm:
Find total sum.
Keep a left sum.
right = total - left - nums[i].
If left == right, that's the pivot.

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    int pivotIndex(vector<int>& a) {
        int total = 0, left = 0;
        for (int x : a) total += x;

        for (int i = 0; i < a.size(); i++) {
            if (left == total - left - a[i])
                return i;
            left += a[i];
        }
        return -1;
    }
};

EX:
nums = [1,7,3,6,5,6]

At i = 3:

nums[i] = nums[3] = 6

So:

[1,7,3] | 6 | [5,6]
  LEFT    ↑     RIGHT
Left = 11
Right = 11

✅ Answer = 3

nums[i] simply means the current element.
